      "created_at": "2018-10-16T16:01:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This one&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\n&gt; </p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>If Countermeasures is in play and an Explosives Wagon is destroyed, Benchmark doesn’t take damage because of the “instead.” Everyone else does, though.</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>\n</p>\n<p>Benchmark should take damage if the Explosive Wagons was destroyed by an effect like Grapplig Hook and was at full health. &nbsp;It would need to be at 2 or less health when trying to hit&nbsp;Benchmark for that to take affect. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:56:17.652Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
